{"overview":"«Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten» یک سریال صابونی طولانی‌مدت آلمانی است که اولین بار در سال ۱۹۹۲ روی شبکه RTL پخش شد؛ این برنامه به زندگی ساکنان خیابانی خیالی در پایتخت آلمان، برلین می‌پردازد و در طول سال‌ها به‌طور مداوم نسل جدیدی از نوجوانان و جوانان اواخر نوجوانی و اوایل بیست‌سالی را به تصویر می‌کشد تا مخاطبان جوان را هدف بگیرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten is a long-running German television soap opera, first broadcast on RTL in 1992. The programme concerns the lives of a fictional neighborhood in Germany's capital city Berlin. Over the years the soap opera tends to have an overhaul of young people in their late teens and early twenties; targeting a young viewership.","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":160,"y":1992,"poster":"/AfOEFu8zXzAHuABj7TzEn45VrB1.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":242,"y":1993,"poster":"/jqoiYjFuD0j8yeSTPwjBjucK98H.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":245,"y":1994,"poster":"/9iFkGLBhlqZGVvYBye0wnx8TyZ.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":241,"y":1995,"poster":"/7P2bAVMjSAEzewzJmFup2sbFHIp.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":249,"y":1996,"poster":"/dajzy6PppZHIwchssfKK1T0hmIO.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":245,"y":1997,"poster":"/ssKXbJgurmeuMmcPoIqGYOoImOy.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":253,"y":1998,"poster":"/x0t65yT09sQ8TueFFdfVsizcrah.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":253,"y":1999,"poster":"/91cFWV7IRteyAK0rCT2BymYehAx.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":250,"y":2000,"poster":"/qTKHT60nnaRw9sj8zDjLGLi3WXp.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":244,"y":2001,"poster":"/oyTbpRRpNlsq3RfPv5dgOgvMrGD.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":250,"y":2002,"poster":"/v0Xy7e3FiNDAg2BimlUEKY1B5CE.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":249,"y":2003,"poster":"/x1QH3TfodvIXVrr7WtDoz4jo3t1.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":253,"y":2004,"poster":"/3u5olfQl3rW1WEGuu86enTZzUpa.jpg"},{"n":14,"name":"فصل 14","ep":255,"y":2005,"poster":"/hSyNPbiAC600Ixm00skBZ2wutAJ.jpg"},{"n":15,"nam